  "body": "Experience modern comfort and effortless living in these beautifully designed, brand-new standalone homes, perfectly positioned in the heart of highly sought-after Bucklands Beach. Set within an exclusive boutique development, these stylish residences combine contemporary design, quality finishes and everyday practicality, offering an exceptional lifestyle in a prime location.\r\n\r\nLot 1 and Lot 5 each feature four generously sized bedrooms, two modern bathrooms and an additional separate toilet, making them ideal for growing families, busy professionals or savvy investors.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern lifestyles, the homes showcase quality finishes, stylish interiors and spacious open-plan living and dining areas that flow seamlessly into private, low-maintenance outdoor spaces. A single internal-access garage, together with additional off-street parking, provides everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWith freehold titles and no body corporate fees, these homes offer the freedom and peace of mind of independent ownership. Location is another outstanding highlight. Zoned for the highly regarded Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain School, these properties are perfectly positioned for families seeking quality education.\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy access to Half Moon Bay Marina, Eastern Beach, Bucklands Beach and Lloyd Elsmore Park, along with nearby shops, cafes, restaurants and convenient ferry connections to Auckland's CBD and Waiheke Island.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a stylish family home, a low-maintenance lifestyle or a smart investment opportunity, these new homes are well worth exploring.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to arrange a private viewing. Don't miss your opportunity to secure a home in one of East Auckland's most desirable locations. \r\n\r\nhttps://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
